    "Details": "The B configuration brings a LB 10-X Autocannon and two Improved Heavy Medium Lasers to deal with larger threats. But it is also geared towards anti-infantry and shredding lightly armored targets with is twin Light Machine Gun Arrays and supercharger.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Rugged</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.06</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
